TinyHttpd is based on NanoHttpd and continues its lightweight embedded HTTP
server approach with a redesigned engine and public API. It was forked from
NanoHttpd commit efb2ebf85a2b06f7c508aba9eaad5377e3a01e81 (2019-07-03).

Upstream project: https://github.com/NanoHttpd/nanohttpd

